  "status": "Refused",
  "actual_commencement_date": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposal particularly the single storey rear extension element, due to its excessive depth, would fail to relate sympathetically or subordinately to the dwelling, appearing overly dominant and significantly altering the appearance of the application property and failing to reflect the townscape characteristics of the area contrary to aims and objectives of Policy 28 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018 and Supplementary Planning Document 4 - Design of Residential Extensions.",
    "The proposal particularly the single storey rear extension element would by virtue of its excessive depth and proximity to the shared side boundary line to the north, result in an adverse impact on the occupiers of 32 Hallmead Road in terms of loss of light, outlook and sense of enclosure contrary to Policy 29 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018 and guidance set out in SPD4 'Design of Residential Extensions'."
  ],
